cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FSSAI-RA: Fail-Secure Sovereign AI Reference Architecture"
message: "If you use this software or its method, please cite both the software and the paper."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Srivastava
    given-names: R.
repository-code: "https://github.com/genaiworks/fssai-ra"
url: "https://github.com/genaiworks/fssai-ra"
abstract: >-
  An extensible, runnable reference platform for specifying and testing the
  authority boundaries of agentic AI. It implements a seven-field control
  contract, bounded model checking of a governance profile's declared authority
  space, ablation-measured authority coverage, and a portable conformance suite
  so that replacing a backend does not silently void the assurance argument.
